<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on dollar/Swiss franc.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on dollar/Swiss franc.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued five million American-style put warrants, on the U.S. dollar and Swiss franc exchange rate, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. Bank said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1.4250 CHF		PREMIUM	8.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     12.99 CHF		 GEARING	10.9 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JAN.97-21.JUL.98   PAYDATE	29.JAN.98</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1.4140  -U.S$/CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
